  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h3> »pomBasic« </h3> <h1> Versatile Optics for Testing and Measuring Tasks </h1>",
   "body": "<p>Whenever you need to perform universal and targeted inspections of cutting tools, ZOLLER »pomBasic« provides you with precise results quickly and simply: angles, radii, distances, cutting edge quality, and Micrograph. The addition of an additional diffuser (LED flat light) flexibly expands the range of applications for transmitted light measurements. This allows, for example, outer contours to be quickly measured and documented.</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"#c3759\">Measurements</a> <a class=\"btn\" href=\"#c3760\">»pomLightTube«</a></p>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/e/3/csm_pombasic_Anwendungen_Optik_37c41c5354.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 1454,
     "h": 1454
    }
   ],
   "videos": [],
   "pos": "right",
   "cols": 1,
   "valign": "center",
   "ftype": "textmedia",
   "id": "c2193",
   "bg": "",
   "space": {
    "before": "small",
    "after": "small"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "overlay",
   "img": {
    "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/f/2/csm_Pombasic_Anwendungen_2_a9c7717a63.webp",
    "alt": "",
    "w": 996,
    "h": 836
   },
   "title": "Measurements",
   "text": "<p>»pomBasic« measures all relevant parameters of all types of cutting tools—such as drill bits, milling cutters, saw blades, forming tools, and cutting inserts—using incident light.</p>",
   "ftype": "zoller_overlay",
   "id": "c3759",
   "bg": "",
   "space": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "overlay",
   "img": {
    "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/7/1/csm_Pombasic_Anwendungen_pomlighttube_2a_320e23ee45.webp",
    "alt": "",
    "w": 996,
    "h": 644
   },
   "title": "»pomLightTube«",
   "text": "<p>Optimal lighting of the complex geometries found in precision tools is a stipulation for perfect inspection and measurement. With the ZOLLER »pomLightTube« illumination system—unique in its design—you can achieve phenomenally uniform image quality, even with geometries that are typically difficult to illuminate and reflective surfaces.</p>",
   "ftype": "zoller_overlay",
   "id": "c3760",
   "bg": "",
   "space": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h3> »pomBasic MTI« </h3> <h2> Ultimate Perfection Through “Micro” Optics </h2>",
   "body": "<p>ZOLLER »pomBasic MTI« stands for Micro Tool Inspection and offers a compact, production-integrated solution for inspection and measurement of microtools. A specialized high-definition microcamera with coaxial illumination enables the exact inspection of even the smallest tools: The zoom lens captures microtools in extreme detail with a magnification range of 125x to 1,250x.</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"#c3761\">Measurements</a> <a class=\"btn\" href=\"#c3762\">»pomLightTube«</a></p>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/5/f/csm_pombasicmicro_anwendungen_optik_b18922f2d7.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 1454,
     "h": 1454
    }
   ],
   "videos": [],
   "pos": "right",
   "cols": 1,
   "valign": "center",
   "ftype": "textmedia",
   "id": "c2194",
   "bg": "black",
   "space": {
    "before": "small",
    "after": "small"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "overlay",
   "img": {
    "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/4/f/csm_Pombasicmicro_Anwendungen_messungen_2_d4d4923e53.webp",
    "alt": "",
    "w": 996,
    "h": 856
   },
   "title": "Measurements",
   "text": "<p>The »pomBasic MTI«, based on the »pomBasic«, offers the same benefits and can be used universally in the measurement room, for incoming inspection, or directly on the production floor.</p>",
   "ftype": "zoller_overlay",
   "id": "c3761",
   "bg": "",
   "space": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "overlay",
   "img": {
    "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/4/e/csm_Pombasicmicro_Anwendungen_pomlighttube_2_eda92f127c.webp",
    "alt": "",
    "w": 996,
    "h": 872
   },
   "title": "Micro Tool Inspection for Micro-Tools",
   "text": "<p>With ZOLLER »pomBasic MTI«, you can inspect even the smallest details with the utmost precision—we call this ZOLLER’s top performance for consistent quality in your microtools.</p>",
   "ftype": "zoller_overlay",
   "id": "c3762",
   "bg": "",
   "space": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> Tool Inspection: Thoughtfully Designed in Every Detail </h2>",
   "body": "<p>Assistant-guided measurement sequences, complete inspection reports at the touch of a button, and tool-specific management of all parameters in the central ZOLLER tool database, z.One, ensure efficient production processes and traceable quality at all times.</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/ca/company/contact\">Request</a> <a class=\"btn\" href=\"https://myzoller.com/de/de/expert/booking/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">a 1:1 consultation with an expert</a> <a class=\"btn\" href=\"/ca/company/contact\">now</a></p>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/5/f/csm_pombasic__preview_d99311c8eb.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 1080,
     "h": 858
    }
   ],
